{"a":[28,28],"h":"<p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"178\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 177.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 38.3 45.0 45.0 60.7 71.3 78.0 78.0 87.0 87.0 94.6 110.3 117.0 125.3 125.3 125.3 132.0 147.7 147.7 154.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"38.3 60.7 87.0 117.0 132.0 154.6 161.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Ey o bütün iyman edenler! - Ya'ni geçen Resullere iyman edip de ahidlerine riayet eyliyen ve ecre nâil olmuş bulunan mü'minler şimdi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"105\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 104.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.4 53.3 60.0 68.3 68.3 75.0 75.0 81.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 75.0 88.4\" y=\"26.3 21.0 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Allahdan korkun - o fâsıkların mevkıine düşmekten sakının - da<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 133.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.8 39.0 50.3 57.8 57.8 73.6 80.3 88.6 88.6 95.3 95.3 102.0 102.0 108.8\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.0 50.3 108.8 117.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Resulüne iyman edin - ya'ni son gönderdiği Resulü Muhammed Mustafa Sallâllahü aleyhi veselleme dahi iyman edin <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"205\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 204.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 30.0 39.0 39.0 51.0 68.3 68.3 78.7 78.7 94.6 94.6 105.0 105.0 111.7 118.6 118.6 125.3 125.3 145.6 145.6 154.6 154.6 166.6 166.6 173.3 173.3 173.3 181.6 181.6\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25